- **Tokens & theme:** `src/app/globals.css` (CSS variables, landing overrides).
- **Landing:** `src/app/page.tsx`, `src/components/landing/*`.
- **App shell:** `src/app/app/layout.tsx`, `src/components/app/app-sidebar.tsx`, `src/components/dashboard/*`.
